BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260825T221500Z
DTEND:20260825T231500Z
DTSTAMP:20260825T000000Z
SUMMARY:Vinyasa and the Seven Chakras-Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we learn about the foundations of Vinyasa Yoga while 
 also exploring the seven chakras and its relation to yoga poses.\n\nWhether 
 new to yoga or a current practitioner\, all are welcome to attend the 
 program.\n\nClasses will be taught at an open level by a 200-Hour Vinyasa 
 and 20-Hour Yin certified instructor\, Raymond Camacho. It is not necessary 
 to attend every session. Please feel free to join any of the classes. Bring 
 your own Yoga mat.\n\nIf you don't have a mat\, please email 
 name@example.org\; we have a limited amount on hand that you 
 can borrow. \n\nPlease arrive five minutes early. Check-in closes at 6:30 
 p.m. Anyone arriving after 6:30 p.m. will not be permitted to attend the 
 session.\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:August, Popular Events > Health and Wellness Events, Popular Events > Summer Break JC
UID:LibCal-17419-17296775
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17296775
END:VEVENT
