BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260827T220000Z
DTEND:20260828T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260827T000000Z
SUMMARY:Adult Summer Break: Improv JAM!
DESCRIPTION:Improv Level 1 – 6-Week Course Led by Logan Kovach & MP White 
 of Pop-Off Improv\n\nReady to think on your feet? Join this 6-week 
 cumulative Improv Level 1 course and learn the basics of improvisational 
 theater in a fun\, supportive environment. No experience needed — just 
 bring your creativity and sense of humor!\n\n📅 Every Monday | June 29 
 – August 3 | 6-8pm 📍 PGML – Multipurpose Room\, 4th Floor\n\n\nJam 
 Sessions (All Levels Welcome) Once a month\, anyone interested in improv is 
 encouraged to join our Level 1 and Level 2 participants and graduates for 
 an open session of improv fun! Come to support\, or to grace the stage\, no 
 experience required.\n\nJune 11 | 6–8pm \, July 11 | 1–3pm \,  August 
 27 | 6–8pm 📍 PGML – Multipurpose Room\, 4th Floor\n\n\n⭐ Grand 
 Performance – August 10 | 6–8pm PGML – Multipurpose Room\, 4th 
 Floor\n\n\nAbout the Instructors\n\nLogan Kovach is co-founder of Pop-Off 
 Improv. He has performed and produced shows Off-Broadway\, appeared in 
 theatre festivals across the nation\, and can be seen on HBO\, ABC\, and in 
 major motion pictures. Logan holds a directing degree from Miami 
 University.\n\nMP White is co-founder of Pop-Off Improv and has taught 
 every class since its launch in 2023. MP performs as a member of NYC's PIT 
 Ensemble Team\, Kind Regards\, trained with UCB in LA\, and has performed 
 with Chaps at Court Square Theatre in Long Island City.\n\n \n
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:August, July, June, Popular Events > Fun and Games Events
UID:LibCal-17419-16970979
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/16970979
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260828T140000Z
DTEND:20260828T220000Z
