SUMMARY:Author Talk: Katie Yee
DESCRIPTION:Join the Jersey City Free Public Library and Katie Yee\, author 
 of Maggie\; or\, A Man and a Woman Walk Into a Bar\, for a reading and 
 conversation about heartbreak\, friendship\, craft\, and the strength to be 
 found in the stories we tell ourselves. The reading and conversation will 
 be followed by a signing. \n\nMaggie\; or\, A Man and a Woman Walk Into a 
 Bar was a New York Times Notable Book and was longlisted for the 
 PEN/Hemingway Award for Debut Novel. Copies of Maggie will be available for 
 purchase at the event from WORD Bookstore.
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Author Talks
