SUMMARY:Celebrate Baseball!
DESCRIPTION:The Elysian Fields Chapter of the Society for American Baseball 
 Research and the Jersey City Free Public Library's New Jersey Room invite 
 you to Celebrate Baseball! Join us for an afternoon full of baseball talk 
 and music from Jersey City native Len Pasculli\, who will talk about 
 Baseball\, Business\, and Jackie Robinson. Author Rob Fitts will take us 
 behind the scenes of Japanese professional baseball\, and give a listen to 
 Yankee Stadium organist Ed Alstrom\, who will perform right here at the 
 Priscilla Garner Main Library!
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
