SUMMARY:Mandala Art
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxing and creative mandala art workshop\, 
 guided by local Jersey City artist Samiksha Niyogi\, where we’ll be 
 drawing our own unique mandala patterns! This beginner-friendly session is 
 a wonderful way to learn mandala art techniques.\n\nAll materials will be 
 provided. Bring your curiosity and enjoy an afternoon of art at the 
 library.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n\n	 A quick introduction to mandala 
 art\n	Step-by-step guidance for drawing mandala patterns\n	A calm\, 
 creative space inside the library\n	Time to experiment with your own 
 designs\n	Finished bookmarks to take home\n\n\nLimited spots available. 
 Register now!\n\n
