SUMMARY:Adult Fall Program - QWERT: Type in - Type Writing Program
DESCRIPTION:Typewriter Type-In with QWERT Poetry\n\nUnplug and tap into 
 your words! Join QWERT Poetry for a hands-on Typewriter Type-In\, open to 
 writers and non-writers alike. Pierce of QWERT Poetry will guide 
 participants through the mechanics of manual typewriters (no experience 
 needed) and offer writing prompts to help you get started.\n\nSix fully 
 functional manual typewriters will be set up with paper\, envelopes\, and 
 wax seals\, along with character cards describing each machine and how-to 
 sheets for reference. By the end of the session\, every participant will 
 walk away with a finished piece of writing.\n\nNo experience necessary — 
 just bring your curiosity!
LOCATION:PGML: 3rd Floor | Conference Room 1
CATEGORIES:October, Popular Events > Arts and Crafts Events, Popular Events > Educational Workshops, Popular Events > Social Gatherings
