SUMMARY:JCFPL Presents: Sabor Food Crawl
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with JCFPL at our 1st Sabor 
 Food Crawl   Latin Food Fair! 🎉\n\nCome walk and connect with us as we 
 make our way to 3 Latinx-owned businesses in Jersey City! Only 40 spots 
 available! \n\nThis is a chance to discover local businesses\, meet new 
 people\, enjoy free samples at each stop\, and support the Latinx 
 entrepreneurs helping make our community so vibrant.\n\n👟 Walk  ☕️ 
 Sip  🥐 Sample  🤎 Support Local\n\nMore details coming soon!\n\n📍 
 Meet at the Priscilla Gardner Main Library at 10:45am. We'll depart no 
 later than 11:10am.\n\n⚠️ Space is limited to 40 participants — 
 please register only once so everyone gets a fair shot at joining.\n\n🕐 
 Please arrive on time. Due to the walking format\, we won't be able to 
 accommodate late arrivals.
