SUMMARY:JCFPL Presents: Latin Food Fair!
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with JCFPL at our Latin Food 
 Fair! 🎉\n\nCome hungry! Join us for an afternoon celebrating Latin 
 culture and cuisine\, featuring 10 Latin-owned restaurants selling and 
 offering free samples of their best dishes and drinks.\n\n📍 Priscilla 
 Gardner Main Library Multipurpose Room\, starting at 2pm.\n\n⚠️ Space 
 is limited to 80 participants — please register only once so everyone 
 gets a fair shot at joining.\n\n🍽️ Already joining the Sabor Food 
 Crawl? You're welcome to stick around for the Food Fair too — just make 
