SUMMARY:Yin Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Join Us for an hour of yin yoga class\, where we focus on 
 holding poses for 3-5 minutes\, breathing into the muscles and releasing 
 what doesn't serve in the body. Yin Yoga is a slow practice that challenges 
 you to be still\, reflecting on the thoughts in the mind\, and breathing 
 into the parts of the body that feel tight. How much tension does your body 
 hold? Are you curious about being still? Come join us for a relaxing and 
 restorative Yin Yoga practice!
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:October, Popular Events > Health and Wellness Events, Popular Events > Older Adults Events, September
