SUMMARY:The Art of Salsa Dance - BEGINNER
DESCRIPTION:\n\nThe Art of Salsa Dance - BEGINNER\n\nThe Art of Salsa Dance 
 is back!\n\nThis Fall 2026\, join us on Wednesdays & select Tuesdays for a 
 fun and welcoming Salsa dance class where you’ll 
 learn:\n\n\n	\n	Essential On1 technique\n	\n	\n	Partner work\n	\n	\n	Basic 
 shines (solo footwork)\n	\n	\n	Musical foundations that shape the many 
 styles of salsa\n	\n\n\nBeginner level: No prior dance experience needed! 
 This is an introductory class. Students will learn Salsa On1 essentials 
 that will help you move confidently on the dance floor.\n\nAll classes are 
 open to adults and teens (ages 12 ). Please wear comfortable clothing and 
 shoes—and bring your energy!\n\nThe Art of Salsa Dance is a 
 community-rooted arts education program celebrating the cultural legacy of 
 Salsa born of migration\, resilience\, and musical innovation.\n\nTo learn 
 more about our other classes and events\, visit Keniadance.com/upcoming and 
 give us a follow @keniadance to stay up to date. \n\nThis program is 
 supported in part by public funds from the Jersey City Arts and Culture 
 Trust Fund and is presented by Kenia Rosete Dance in collaboration with 
 Jersey City Free Public Library.
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Music and Dance Events, September
