SUMMARY:Adult Fall Program: Improv with Pop-Off Improv
DESCRIPTION:Improv Level 2 6-Week Course Led by Logan Kovach & MP White of 
 Pop-Off Improv\n\nTake your improv skills to the next level in this 6-week 
 cumulative Improv Level 2 course! We will build on the basics of 
 environment\, relationship and conflict in a fun\, supportive environment. 
 Prior Level 1 improv experience with Pop-Off Improv or another theater is 
 highly recommended.\n\n📅 Every Monday | Oct 26 – November 30 | 6-8pm 
 📍 PGML – Multipurpose Room\, 4th Floor\n\n\n \n\n⭐ Grand Performance 
 – December 7 | 6–8pm PGML – Multipurpose Room\, 4th Floor\n\n\nAbout 
 the Instructors\n\nLogan Kovach is co-founder of Pop-Off Improv. He has 
 performed and produced shows Off-Broadway\, appeared in theatre festivals 
 across the nation\, and can be seen on HBO\, ABC\, and in major motion 
 pictures. Logan holds a directing degree from Miami University.\n\nMP White 
 is co-founder of Pop-Off Improv and has taught every class since its launch 
 in 2023. MP performs as a member of NYC's PIT Ensemble Team\, Kind 
 Regards\, trained with UCB in LA\, and has performed with Chaps at Court 
 Square Theatre in Long Island City.\n\n \n
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:December, November, October, Popular Events > Fun and Games Events
