SUMMARY:Library of Shadows: Halloween Bash Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:As twilight settles over Jersey City\, the Jersey City Free 
 Public Library Foundation transforms the library into an extraordinary 
 after-hours sanctuary for Library of Shadows: A Halloween Bash Fundraiser.  
 \n\nOn Friday\, October 30\, 2026\, from 7:00 PM to 11:00 PM\, guests aged 
 21 and older are invited to step beyond the quiet reading rooms and into a 
 hauntingly elevated celebration. The evening brings the stacks to life with 
 a live DJ\, dynamic entertainment\, and an immersive photo booth to capture 
 every shadow and silhouette. Guests can sip specialty themed drinks\, enjoy 
 gourmet hors d'oeuvres\, and showcase their creativity in a costume 
 contest.  \n\nMore than a Halloween celebration\, this gathering directly 
 supports the Jersey City Free Public Library Foundation's ongoing mission 
 and community initiatives.\n\n21 & Older Event \n\nRegister here: 
 https://jerseycityfreepubliclibraryfoundation-bloom.kindful.com/e/library-of-shadow-2026\n\n
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:Popular Events, Popular Events > Fun and Games Events, Popular Events > Social Gatherings
