SUMMARY:High School Admission JC
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative presentation with Jane Urry from 
 High School Admission JC\, designed to support families of students 
 preparing for the high school admission process.\n\nDuring this session\, 
 Jane will help families better understand the key steps involved in 
 applying to high school\, including:\n\n\n	Completing and submitting 
 applications\n	Submitting academic records\n	Preparing for entrance 
 testing\n	Understanding the interview process\n	Learning how schools 
 evaluate student qualifications\n\n\nThe goal of this presentation is to 
 help families feel more prepared\, informed\, and confident as they 
 navigate the high school admission process.\n\nWe encourage families to 
 attend and take advantage of this valuable opportunity to learn what to 
 expect and how to best support their students.\n\n
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Educational Workshops, Popular Events > Teen Programs
