SUMMARY:Wellness Wednesdays at Priscilla Gardner Main Library!
DESCRIPTION:Join Priscilla Gardner Main Library as we welcome Hudson 
 Regional Health Commission\, Jersey City Medical Center\, the Jersey City 
 Department of Health & Human Services for Wellness Wednesdays. 
 \n\nPriscilla Gardner Main Library will have the following 
 available:\n\n\n	Vaccines (Covid-19 and Flu)\n	\n		Children under the age 
 of 3 cannot receive the flu vaccine. \n	\n	\n	Blood Pressure and Blood 
 Sugar Readings\n	Monthly information sessions on a variety of health and 
 wellness topics\n	A representative from Aetna to discuss signing up for 
 Medicaid or Medicare\n\n\nRegistrations preferred! Walk-ins ARE 
 welcome!\n\nPlease register at the following link: 
 https://hudsoncountyvax.org/.\n\nNote:\n\nPlease note that on the following 
 dates\, the scheduled time will be 1:30 PM – 5:00 
 PM:\n\n\n	\n	Wednesday\, September 2\, 2026\n	\n	\n	Wednesday\, November 
 4\, 2026\n	\n	\n	Wednesday\, December 2\, 2026\n	\n\n\nThank You.
