SUMMARY:Resume Building Workshop Series: Featuring Briana Ortiz
DESCRIPTION:Resume Building Workshop with Briana Ortiz\n\nJoin Briana 
 Ortiz\, founder of Neighbors Studio and known for creating accessible 
 spaces and programming for local creatives and residents\, for a hands-on 
 resume building workshop. Briana brings her strengths in community-building 
 and practical guidance to help you craft a resume that gets noticed\, 
 covering formatting\, key sections\, action verbs\, tailoring to job 
 postings\, and handling gaps or career changes.\n\nThis 1.5-hour session 
 includes live drafting\, peer review\, and expert feedback\, plus a Q&A to 
 close things out.\n\nSpace is limited per branch\, register today!
LOCATION:PGML: 3rd Floor | Conference Room 1
CATEGORIES:November, Popular Events, Popular Events > Educational Workshops
