SUMMARY:SPANISH for Beginners with Toni
DESCRIPTION:¡Hola! Aprendamos Español\nHello! Let's Learn 
 Spanish\n\nReady to speak\, laugh\, and explore? Learn Spanish in a 
 relaxed\, welcoming class that blends language with the rich culture\, 
 traditions\, and spirit of Spain. Whether you're planning a trip\, 
 connecting with friends and family\, or simply looking for a fun new 
 hobby\, Toni will make every class engaging\, practical\, and 
 memorable.\n\nNo experience needed—just bring your enthusiasm. 
 ¡Vamos!\n\n\n\n
