SUMMARY:Bonetti Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Come read a few stories\, sing\, and dance with Ms. Aleks! This 
 storytime is recommended for 6 months to 2 years. \n\nRegistration 
 information: \n\n\n	This event is capacity-limited\, due to space 
 constraints and because a smaller group means a more focused\, educational 
 storytime!\n	Attendees will be given a ticket upon entry to the Bonetti 
 Room. Before we start storytime\, we will collect tickets. No tickets = no 
 entry to today's storytime.\n	The doors will be closed at 11 AM\, and no 
 one will be admitted after this time until storytime is over at 
 11:30.\n	The same books and songs will be read on Wednesdays and Thursdays! 
 Please choose which one works best for your schedule. \n\n
